SUMMARY:July Mom's  Meetup: Ice Cream Social(Bring the Fam!)
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Community Mom's Group\nHi! I didn't have any signups
  for June\, so I am trying this one again. Hilltop is a great family spot.
  It has cornhole\, a sandbox\, and lots of grass for the kids to roam. I w
 ould love to see you and the whole family there!\n\n**Come solo\, bring yo
 ur kiddo(s) and the whole fam\, join as a new Momma or a seasoned one.**\n
 \n**Hi Momma's! This month\, we will be meeting at Hilltop Ice Cream Woodf
 in. If you haven't been\, it has dairy and vegan options and an amazing ou
 tdoor space with a sandbox and cornhole!**\n\n***\n\n**💛 PLEASE READ 
 💛**\nI’ve had a lot of no-shows in the past\, and this heads-up helps
  me plan better.\nI completely understand if something comes up (because\,
  Mom life!)\, just please try to update your RSVP if your plans change. No
  pressure\, just appreciation.\nThanks so much! 💛
